      "side": 1,
      "message": "We discussed this internally and decided that we don\u0027t want to have this tool perform the \"enter bootloader\" operation. We already have this capability with `ectool --name\u003dcros_fp enter_bootloader`, so we don\u0027t want to duplicate it here. Removing it will simplify the code.\n\nSimilarly, we should remove `get_ec_version` (`ectool --name\u003dcros_fp version`) and the \"enter_rom\" mode from the test firmware. That will allow us to completely remove the EC command logic from this tool.",
      "range": {
