      "message": "Gemini feedback:\n\n---\n\n**Use Span\u0027s `first()` Method** In `updater.cc`, to enforce safer bounds-checking instead of using the explicit span constructor:\n\n```c\n// Instead of:\nDownloadPage(device, target_addr, kFocalConfigSize, {buffer.data(), kFocalConfigSize});\n\n// Use:\nDownloadPage(device, target_addr, kFocalConfigSize, buffer.first(kFocalConfigSize));\n\n```\n\n`first()` will assert at runtime if the requested size exceeds the span, immediately failing fast rather than silently creating an invalid memory view.",
